      },
      "excerpt": "Title:\n[FR] Safe softmax\n\n\nURL:\nhttps://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/55056\n\n\nProject:\npytorch/pytorch\n\n",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:2ee21e009ab6c434c03ee74fa7518cb51fd389493cd8a1848ca6bd3eeaf1d304"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_bug_description_53698d429e10",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "bug_description",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 54,
        "end_line": 81
      },
      "excerpt": "Description:\n\nWhen softmax is applied to an input tensor where all values are negative infinity,\nthe output contains NaN values.\n\nThe reason is that softmax internally performs exponential normalization.\n\nFor an input:\n\n[-inf, -inf, -inf]\n\nthe computation becomes:\n\nexp(-inf) = 0\n\nand:\n\n0 / (0 + 0 + 0)\n\nwhich results in NaN.\n\nThis behavior can occur in transformer attention mechanisms where attention masks\nremove all valid positions for a query.\n\nThe issue proposes a safer softmax behavior where fully masked rows return zeros\ninstead of NaN.\n\n",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:488945a46b5febe9060fbcface7e6468a1be9509eccde4e13d5f4dec8097d108"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_observed_output_a7f709008cda",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "observed_output",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 114,
        "end_line": 122
      },
      "excerpt": "Observed:\n\ntensor([\n    nan,\n    nan,\n    nan\n])\n\n",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:855ae4350fb5df381833b32cac8ab6a8655c25e1d9b3d201b4952f9a0f729cf3"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_api_reference_f20584a5e092",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "api_reference",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 17,
        "end_line": 26
      },
      "excerpt": "API:\ntorch.softmax\n\n\nRelated APIs:\ntorch.nn.functional.softmax\ntorch.nn.Softmax\ntorch.nn.MultiheadAttention\n\n",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:f7255b0d626a8fd403e65f10d5745afbc2399727b422f6e6f18207b5e01bfb12"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_reproduction_b01f26648193",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "reproduction",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 123,
        "end_line": 139
      },
      "excerpt": "Minimal Reproduction:\n\n```python\nimport torch\n\nx = torch.tensor(\n    [\n        float(\"-inf\"),\n        float(\"-inf\"),\n        float(\"-inf\")\n    ]\n)\n\ny = torch.softmax(x, dim=0)\n\nprint(y)\nprint(torch.isnan(y))",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:b8706c887c8cd1f7725e786c9742d0bb383e44d6c8925ac3e3ec88aeb18fb901"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_expected_behavior_0a592a6c7297",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "expected_behavior",
